        </layout>
       </item>
       <item>
        <widget class="QTextEdit" name="textEdit">
         <property name="minimumSize">
          <size>
           <width>0</width>
           <height>361</height>
          </size>
         </property>
         <property name="readOnly">
          <bool>true</bool>
         </property>
         <property name="html">
          <string>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;meta charset=&quot;utf-8&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
hr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }
li.unchecked::marker { content: &quot;\2610&quot;; }
li.checked::marker { content: &quot;\2612&quot;; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI'; font-size:9pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;Descrizione&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt;&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt; font-weight:600; color:#00aa00;&quot;&gt;Layer DEM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt;&quot;&gt;: Raster del Modello Digitale di Elevazione del terreno (DEM), con un Sistema di Riferimento Spaziale (CRS) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;proiettato. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt; font-weight:600; color:#00aa00;&quot;&gt;Estensione&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;: Indica la modalità di calcolo dei valori statistici per i valori minimi, medi e massimi di elevazione ottenuti dalla banda del raster. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt; font-weight:600; color:#00aa00;&quot;&gt;Banda&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt;&quot;&gt;: Contiene le informazioni necessarie per il calcolo dell'altitudine. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt; font-weight:600; color:#00aa00;&quot;&gt;Limite di bacino&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt;&quot;&gt;: Layer vettoriale contenete il poligono dell'area di bacino idrografico. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt; font-weight:600; color:#00aa00;&quot;&gt;Nr. intervalli&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt;&quot;&gt;: Numero di classi di ampiezza uguale in cui suddividere gli intervalli di quota all'interno del bacino idrografico. Questo numero è variabile da &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt;&quot;&gt; a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt;&quot;&gt;. Ad ogni modo il numero consigliato è tra i &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt; color:#0055ff;&quot;&gt;250-300&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt;&quot;&gt;, poiché da questo punto in poi il valore di HI si stabilizza notevolmente, con variazioni minime. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt; font-weight:600; color:#00aa00;&quot;&gt;hmin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt;&quot;&gt;: Valore per la quota minima del DEM all'interno dell'area del bacino idrografico. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt; font-weight:600; color:#00aa00;&quot;&gt;hmax&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt;&quot;&gt;: Valore per  la quota massima del DEM all'interno dell'area del bacino idrografico. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt; font-weight:600; color:#00aa00;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt;&quot;&gt;: Area totale del bacino idrografico, ossia la superficie complessiva delimitata dal poligono del bacino. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt; font-weight:600; color:#00aa00;&quot;&gt;HI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt;&quot;&gt;: Valore dell'integrale ipsometrico. Le curve convesse caratterizzano regioni giovani leggermente erose (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt; color:#0055ff;&quot;&gt;HI &amp;gt; 0.6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt;&quot;&gt;), quelle a forma di '&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt; color:#0055ff;&quot;&gt;S&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt;&quot;&gt;' caratterizzano regioni moderatamente erose (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt; color:#0055ff;&quot;&gt;0.35 &amp;lt;= HI &amp;lt;= 0.6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt;&quot;&gt;), mentre quelle concave indicano regioni vecchie e altamente erose (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt; color:#0055ff;&quot;&gt;HI &amp;lt; 0.35&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt;&quot;&gt;). &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt; font-weight:600; color:#00aa00;&quot;&gt;da&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt;&quot;&gt;: aree interne agli intervalli definiti. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt; font-weight:600; color:#00aa00;&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt;&quot;&gt;: Aree cumulative. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt; font-weight:600; color:#00aa00;&quot;&gt;a/A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt;&quot;&gt;: Normalizzazione delle aree cumulative. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt; font-weight:600; color:#00aa00;&quot;&gt;h&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt;&quot;&gt;: intervalli di altezza.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt; font-weight:600; color:#00aa00;&quot;&gt;hmed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt;&quot;&gt;: altezza media del bacino idrografico. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt; font-weight:600; color:#00aa00;&quot;&gt;h/H&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt;&quot;&gt;: Normalizzazione delle altezze.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;Modalità di utilizzo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt;&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt;&quot;&gt;Per ottimizzare i calcoli, si consiglia di ritagliare il layer raster del DEM in modo che copra un'area leggermente più ampia del perimetro del bacino idrografico. Inoltre, è fondamentale verificare e correggere eventuali valori NoData presenti nel layer DEM prima di procedere con le operazioni, utilizzando gli strumenti dedicati disponibili in QGIS.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
         </property>
        </widget>
       </item>
       <item>
